WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:38.230
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.500 --> 01:43.030
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.080 --> 01:43.720
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.720 --> 01:45.870
[Episode 20]

5
01:55.680 --> 01:56.479
I presume

6
01:57.039 --> 01:58.680
this is the former citizen of Liluo

7
01:58.680 --> 02:00.310
you've been suspecting

8
02:00.310 --> 02:01.760
all along.

9
02:03.280 --> 02:05.000
You don't actually suspect

10
02:08.310 --> 02:10.360
that I'm from Liluo, do you?

11
02:17.310 --> 02:18.240
Master.

12
02:20.800 --> 02:22.630
You raised me for 17 years,

13
02:23.680 --> 02:24.960
fed me,

14
02:25.680 --> 02:27.010
taught me martial arts,

15
02:28.400 --> 02:30.190
and instructed me in the mystical arts,

16
02:30.190 --> 02:32.190
medicine, divination, and astrology.

17
02:32.190 --> 02:33.590
Such kindness and grace—

18
02:36.190 --> 02:39.120
I, Li Si, shall never forget them for as long as I live.

19
02:41.800 --> 02:42.660
And I, Zhou Yan,

20
02:44.470 --> 02:46.930
shall carry them in my heart forever as well.

21
02:47.190 --> 02:48.000
Chang Bo.

22
02:48.630 --> 02:50.680
When you joined the Divine Constable Bureau,

23
02:50.680 --> 02:52.470
I wasn't Chief yet.

24
02:52.800 --> 02:52.870
You and I were colleagues.

25
02:52.870 --> 02:54.840
[Former Head Constable of the Divine Constable Bureau, Chang Bo]

26
02:54.840 --> 02:55.910
Given your experience,

27
02:55.910 --> 02:57.770
if you had remained in the Bureau,

28
02:57.840 --> 03:00.360
you would undoubtedly have secured a place

29
03:00.470 --> 03:02.800
among the current Four Divine Constables.

30
03:02.800 --> 03:04.500
Chief, you flatter me.

31
03:04.630 --> 03:06.280
You're saying he was with the Divine Constable Bureau?

32
03:06.280 --> 03:07.710
Seventeen years ago,

33
03:08.280 --> 03:10.470
after the incident at Mulan Hunting Ground,

34
03:10.470 --> 03:12.400
I took over as Chief.

35
03:12.870 --> 03:14.280
The first thing I did

36
03:14.800 --> 03:17.150
was expel Chang Bo from the Bureau

37
03:17.470 --> 03:19.120
and have him secretly investigate

38
03:19.120 --> 03:21.450
the whereabouts of the remnants of Liluo.

39
03:21.840 --> 03:22.960
Li Si said

40
03:23.079 --> 03:25.430
he had people searching everywhere for you,

41
03:25.430 --> 03:27.800
claiming you'd been frequenting Lanyue Pavilion.

42
03:27.800 --> 03:29.680
I only frequented Lanyue Pavilion

43
03:29.680 --> 03:31.310
in search of a person—

44
03:31.680 --> 03:32.960
a Liluo citizen.

45
03:33.000 --> 03:34.000
You mean the former citizen of Liluo

46
03:34.000 --> 03:35.590
who incited Tang Wei and Tang Yiming

47
03:35.590 --> 03:36.630
to commit murder?

48
03:36.800 --> 03:38.680
I know nothing of this person's

49
03:38.680 --> 03:40.790
identity, background, or real name.

50
03:40.910 --> 03:42.190
For seventeen years,

51
03:42.190 --> 03:43.520
I've traveled far and wide,

52
03:43.520 --> 03:44.630
working day and night,

53
03:44.630 --> 03:46.470
and all I've managed to uncover is a surname:

54
03:46.470 --> 03:48.800
Li—as in "common people."

55
03:49.000 --> 03:50.790
And it's also the "Li" in the name of Divine Constable Qingyang,

56
03:50.790 --> 03:52.120
Li Si.

57
03:56.430 --> 03:57.680
I've always believed

58
04:00.030 --> 04:01.090
that our encounter

59
04:01.870 --> 04:03.600
in the deep mountains that year

60
04:04.910 --> 04:06.360
was just a coincidence.

61
04:12.840 --> 04:14.750
But so much has happened lately

62
04:16.040 --> 04:17.560
that I can't help but think

63
04:18.680 --> 04:20.410
there was more to our encounter

64
04:20.800 --> 04:22.430
than I realized.

65
04:46.830 --> 04:48.360
I've known you for years,

66
04:50.040 --> 04:51.240
and this is the first time

67
04:51.240 --> 04:53.500
I've heard you talk in circles like this.

68
04:55.000 --> 04:56.510
If you have something to say,

69
04:56.510 --> 04:57.310
just say it.

70
05:02.430 --> 05:04.090
I'd like to meet Lou Tianming.

71
05:05.600 --> 05:06.430
I'm guessing

72
05:09.040 --> 05:10.240
you two have known each other

73
05:10.240 --> 05:11.920
for quite some time, haven't you?

74
05:11.920 --> 05:12.950
Lou Tianming?

75
05:13.870 --> 05:14.830
Let me think.

76
05:14.830 --> 05:16.480
Lou Tianming...

77
05:16.830 --> 05:20.000
Lou Tianming, Lou Tianming, Lou Tianming...

78
05:20.430 --> 05:21.750
I don't know him.

79
05:23.800 --> 05:24.800
Do you believe me?

80
05:40.240 --> 05:42.040
I don't know him!

81
05:43.070 --> 05:44.870
I really don't know him.

82
05:47.430 --> 05:49.230
If only I could actually say that

83
05:50.800 --> 05:52.730
and you would actually believe it.

84
06:00.040 --> 06:01.240
If that were the case,

85
06:02.120 --> 06:04.510
then wouldn't you have spent those 17 years

86
06:04.510 --> 06:06.310
raising a fool, Master?

87
06:08.480 --> 06:10.610
Those who are too wise often die young.

88
06:11.000 --> 06:12.930
Sometimes, being a little foolish

89
06:13.190 --> 06:15.000
helps you live longer.

90
06:18.630 --> 06:19.430
Master.

91
06:20.680 --> 06:22.370
Weren't you just telling me

92
06:22.630 --> 06:24.240
not to beat around the bush?

93
06:24.240 --> 06:25.040
Why

94
06:25.600 --> 06:27.860
are you the one changing the subject now?

95
06:32.830 --> 06:34.490
There's too much I want to say,

96
06:37.430 --> 06:39.560
and I simply don't know where to start.

97
06:41.070 --> 06:42.400
Then should I ask first,

98
06:43.800 --> 06:45.800
or will you speak first, Master?

99
06:46.800 --> 06:48.310
I'll ask first.

100
06:50.390 --> 06:52.310
When did you start suspecting me?

101
06:58.480 --> 06:59.430
A few days ago,

102
07:00.040 --> 07:01.700
at Jiang Zeshui's residence,

103
07:01.830 --> 07:04.030
we captured a demon-men assassin alive

104
07:05.000 --> 07:07.930
and threw him into the Divine Constable Bureau's prison.

105
07:07.930 --> 07:09.240
What happened?

106
07:09.600 --> 07:11.000
He endured all those tortures without breaking.

107
07:11.000 --> 07:12.730
Why did he suddenly go berserk?

108
07:13.000 --> 07:14.870
The way that demon-man went berserk

109
07:14.870 --> 07:16.190
was remarkably similar to how I am

110
07:16.190 --> 07:19.520
when my heart meridians flare up and the burning takes hold.

111
07:20.190 --> 07:22.600
Then something happened

112
07:23.600 --> 07:25.120
that suddenly improved

113
07:25.270 --> 07:27.000
his condition.

114
07:33.190 --> 07:34.480
There are still a few pills left inside.

115
07:34.480 --> 07:35.610
Save them for later.

116
07:39.630 --> 07:41.159
When I picked the bottle up,

117
07:41.830 --> 07:42.830
the pills inside

118
07:43.390 --> 07:44.680
were already gone.

119
07:45.430 --> 07:46.240
That was when

120
07:47.430 --> 07:48.720
I realized.

121
07:51.510 --> 07:53.000
This medicine has a name.

122
07:53.240 --> 07:55.270
It's called the Demon-Suppressing Pill.

123
07:55.270 --> 07:57.070
It's used to suppress

124
07:57.070 --> 07:59.040
the Chiying Bug Venom within demon-men's bodies.

125
07:59.040 --> 08:00.560
If not taken regularly,

126
08:01.120 --> 08:02.720
the victim will lose their mind,

127
08:02.720 --> 08:03.800
suffer unbearable pain,

128
08:03.800 --> 08:05.260
go berserk,

129
08:06.000 --> 08:07.750
and eventually die.

130
08:14.120 --> 08:16.120
The first time you fell ill that year

131
08:17.480 --> 08:19.630
was exactly when the Chiying Bug Venom I had planted in you

132
08:19.630 --> 08:21.040
took effect.

133
08:30.190 --> 08:31.720
Master...

134
08:32.200 --> 08:33.440
Save me...

135
08:34.000 --> 08:35.289
Save me...

136
08:39.440 --> 08:41.640
So you've finally admitted it yourself

137
08:42.030 --> 08:43.200
that what I have is

138
08:43.789 --> 08:45.630
the Chiying Bug Venom.

139
08:54.720 --> 08:56.720
And of course, you know now

140
08:57.080 --> 08:59.080
that what I've been preparing for you every month

141
08:59.080 --> 09:02.510
isn't some "All-Nourishing Pill",

142
09:03.080 --> 09:05.120
but rather the "Demon-Suppressing Pill",

143
09:05.120 --> 09:07.720
designed to suppress the worm toxin within you

144
09:08.030 --> 09:09.890
that could flare up at any moment.

145
09:12.840 --> 09:14.150
Seventeen years ago,

146
09:15.440 --> 09:19.420
the Fourth Prince, Zhou Yan, was exceptionally gifted

147
09:19.790 --> 09:22.010
and deeply favored by the Emperor.

148
09:22.240 --> 09:23.750
Everyone was convinced

149
09:23.790 --> 09:26.050
that the one to inherit the throne one day

150
09:27.630 --> 09:29.440
would definitely be Zhou Yan.

151
09:30.480 --> 09:33.680
Zhou Yan accompanied His Majesty on a hunting expedition

152
09:34.080 --> 09:35.910
when he suffered a tragic accident

153
09:35.910 --> 09:37.750
and met an untimely death.

154
09:39.510 --> 09:40.790
Everyone assumed

155
09:41.840 --> 09:43.440
Zhou Yan had died of illness,

156
09:44.000 --> 09:45.030
but in truth,

157
09:45.790 --> 09:47.240
this so-called accident

158
09:48.000 --> 09:49.120
was a

159
09:49.910 --> 09:52.240
carefully orchestrated murder.

160
09:52.790 --> 09:54.000
You kept saying

161
09:54.000 --> 09:56.080
you wanted to uncover the truth.

162
09:56.630 --> 09:58.320
So tell me now—

163
09:58.630 --> 10:01.120
who was the real culprit?

164
10:05.600 --> 10:07.800
Although my eldest and second brothers

165
10:08.000 --> 10:09.440
have never gotten along,

166
10:09.870 --> 10:11.960
they show surprising unity

167
10:13.000 --> 10:14.800
when faced with a common threat.

168
10:15.630 --> 10:17.560
If your eldest brother had done it,

169
10:17.720 --> 10:18.840
the Emperor would surely

170
10:18.840 --> 10:21.170
have punished him once the truth came out,

171
10:21.320 --> 10:22.870
leaving your second brother

172
10:22.870 --> 10:25.600
secure on the Crown Prince's throne.

173
10:26.080 --> 10:28.240
But if your second brother had done it,

174
10:28.670 --> 10:31.080
the Emperor could've easily flown into a rage

175
10:31.080 --> 10:32.810
and replaced the Crown Prince.

176
10:33.840 --> 10:36.080
Either one acting alone

177
10:36.840 --> 10:39.240
would only benefit the other.

178
10:40.390 --> 10:44.000
The only way for both of them to succeed

179
10:45.870 --> 10:47.120
was to join forces.

180
10:49.440 --> 10:50.970
As expected of you, Master.

181
10:51.600 --> 10:52.400
You're right.

182
10:53.440 --> 10:55.720
But even if Father uncovered the truth,

183
10:56.480 --> 10:59.120
what could he really do to my eldest and second brothers?

184
10:59.120 --> 11:01.200
Would he depose them both?

185
11:02.030 --> 11:03.550
And if he did,

186
11:03.910 --> 11:05.360
who would inherit

187
11:06.000 --> 11:07.840
his empire?

188
11:12.510 --> 11:14.910
Back then, the Crown Prince set a trap to have you killed.

189
11:14.910 --> 11:16.040
Your eldest brother

190
11:16.600 --> 11:18.200
used his position in the Ministry of War

191
11:18.200 --> 11:20.000
to fabricate military reports,

192
11:20.080 --> 11:22.000
keeping your father from

193
11:22.510 --> 11:24.640
reaching the hunting grounds in time.

194
11:26.200 --> 11:27.480
We learned of

195
11:27.480 --> 11:29.540
the assassination plot beforehand.

196
11:30.320 --> 11:31.120
Therefore,

197
11:32.000 --> 11:33.750
we were prepared.

198
11:47.510 --> 11:49.150
Like Lou Tianming,

199
11:50.080 --> 11:52.480
you're both members of Liluo's Dark Night.

200
11:52.720 --> 11:54.080
You found a household

201
11:54.080 --> 11:55.870
on the outskirts of Tianhuang City—

202
11:55.870 --> 11:57.390
a small family

203
11:57.840 --> 11:59.480
with no other relatives.

204
12:00.630 --> 12:01.490
As it happened,

205
12:02.200 --> 12:03.960
they had a child

206
12:04.630 --> 12:06.120
who was the same age as me.

207
12:06.720 --> 12:07.720
The Shen family.

208
12:08.930 --> 12:10.490
Shen Lan.

209
12:11.000 --> 12:12.580
You sent demon-men

210
12:12.840 --> 12:14.630
to slaughter the entire Shen family

211
12:14.630 --> 12:16.200
and took Shen Lan to the hunting grounds,

212
12:16.200 --> 12:17.900
-Go home! -dressed him in my clothes,

213
12:17.900 --> 12:21.600
-I want to go home! -so that the Eastern Palace assassins

214
12:21.670 --> 12:24.470
would mistake Shen Lan for me and kill him instead.

215
12:27.910 --> 12:29.390
Then, just as planned,

216
12:29.910 --> 12:31.750
you burned his body,

217
12:32.600 --> 12:35.530
took me away, and abandoned me deep in the mountains.

218
12:35.870 --> 12:36.670
Finally,

219
12:37.200 --> 12:38.530
you staged the whole act

220
12:39.510 --> 12:41.960
of Li San rescuing the Crown Prince.

221
12:43.120 --> 12:44.080
My father,

222
12:44.870 --> 12:45.930
my eldest brother,

223
12:46.440 --> 12:47.640
and my second brother

224
12:47.840 --> 12:48.770
were, of course,

225
12:50.000 --> 12:51.630
completely unaware of this.

226
12:53.200 --> 12:54.720
Flawless, wasn't it?

227
12:57.670 --> 12:59.110
They all believed

228
13:00.000 --> 13:01.440
you were dead.

229
13:05.000 --> 13:05.930
-Chief. -Chief.

230
13:06.200 --> 13:07.120
We've searched everywhere.

231
13:07.120 --> 13:07.910
There was no trace.

232
13:07.910 --> 13:09.440
And Meng Rui is currently

233
13:09.440 --> 13:10.840
nowhere to be found, either.

234
13:10.840 --> 13:11.630
Chief.

235
13:11.840 --> 13:12.840
I believe

236
13:13.200 --> 13:14.790
that Li Si's master, Li San,

237
13:14.790 --> 13:16.390
is a former citizen of Liluo.

238
13:16.630 --> 13:17.390
The two of them

239
13:17.390 --> 13:19.190
must be together at this moment.

240
13:21.240 --> 13:22.170
Pass on my order.

241
13:22.200 --> 13:23.240
Search the entire city

242
13:23.240 --> 13:24.870
for Li Si and Li San.

243
13:29.030 --> 13:29.840
-Yes. -Yes.

244
13:30.000 --> 13:32.200
Master, it's not hard to guess

245
13:32.910 --> 13:34.360
why you raised me.

246
13:36.030 --> 13:37.150
Dark Night

247
13:38.000 --> 13:38.840
only needed to

248
13:38.840 --> 13:40.550
keep me alive.

249
13:41.270 --> 13:42.320
Yet Master,

250
13:43.840 --> 13:45.440
you taught me martial arts,

251
13:45.910 --> 13:47.750
astronomy, geography,

252
13:47.870 --> 13:49.630
medicine, divination, and astrology.

253
13:49.630 --> 13:50.440
You even

254
13:52.200 --> 13:54.800
passed the Heaven-Measuring Ruler down to me.

255
13:56.000 --> 13:57.550
I am deeply grateful.

256
14:00.390 --> 14:01.270
But I suspect

257
14:02.630 --> 14:04.630
your true intention was to have me

258
14:06.910 --> 14:09.170
take part in the struggle for the throne.

259
14:10.960 --> 14:11.750
After all,

260
14:12.080 --> 14:13.270
a crippled man

261
14:14.270 --> 14:16.440
would stand no chance against my eldest and second brothers.

262
14:16.440 --> 14:18.200
But if a Fourth Prince like you,

263
14:18.200 --> 14:20.360
now dashing and handsome,

264
14:20.360 --> 14:21.270
skilled in both the civil and martial arts,

265
14:21.270 --> 14:23.320
and wealthy beyond measure,

266
14:26.000 --> 14:28.750
were to suddenly appear before your father,

267
14:30.030 --> 14:30.840
then he...

268
14:31.240 --> 14:32.270
he would be tempted

269
14:32.270 --> 14:34.790
to make you his heir.

270
14:36.630 --> 14:38.150
Liluo has fallen.

271
14:39.200 --> 14:40.750
Dark Night alone

272
14:41.320 --> 14:43.000
could never restore the kingdom.

273
14:43.000 --> 14:43.960
But if

274
14:45.390 --> 14:47.600
they hold in their hands the future emperor—

275
14:47.600 --> 14:49.750
who must take

276
14:50.000 --> 14:52.000
your specific antidote every month

277
14:53.120 --> 14:54.550
without fail—

278
14:56.630 --> 14:57.830
then restoring Liluo

279
14:58.910 --> 15:00.570
will no longer be a mere dream.

280
15:02.020 --> 15:03.600
Look at the Eastern Palace today

281
15:03.600 --> 15:06.860
and the First Prince who's been placed under house arrest.

282
15:07.670 --> 15:08.510
The throne

283
15:09.720 --> 15:11.520
is meant for none other than you.

284
15:38.390 --> 15:39.480
No matter what,

285
15:44.240 --> 15:45.950
I owe my thanks to

286
15:48.440 --> 15:50.240
you, Master, and Dark Night.

287
15:51.480 --> 15:52.720
If it weren't for you,

288
15:53.450 --> 15:54.550
I would have died at the hands of

289
15:54.550 --> 15:56.750
my eldest and second brothers long ago.

290
15:57.630 --> 16:00.150
On behalf of Zhou Yan, I, Li Si,

291
16:02.670 --> 16:05.270
would like to thank you for raising me, Master.

292
16:06.000 --> 16:08.200
And I'd like to thank the people of Liluo

293
16:09.000 --> 16:10.390
for saving my life.

294
16:15.030 --> 16:17.970
Fate cannot be defied!

295
16:18.480 --> 16:21.280
Heaven's grace is boundless!

296
16:25.670 --> 16:26.840
You must understand

297
16:27.630 --> 16:29.720
that everything I did

298
16:30.480 --> 16:32.790
was to help you reclaim

299
16:33.600 --> 16:36.670
the throne that was yours by right.

300
16:39.510 --> 16:41.200
As long as you obey me,

301
16:42.840 --> 16:44.790
the Chiying Bug Venom in your body

302
16:47.320 --> 16:49.200
will never flare up again.

303
16:58.510 --> 17:00.200
My dear disciple.

304
17:11.890 --> 17:12.740
Master.

305
17:14.200 --> 17:15.700
Do you understand

306
17:16.640 --> 17:19.240
what I meant when I said, "On behalf of Zhou Yan,

307
17:20.200 --> 17:21.960
I, Li Si, thank you?"

308
17:32.270 --> 17:34.240
Zhou Yan died long ago.

309
17:34.880 --> 17:37.340
So how could he possibly inherit the throne?

310
18:13.720 --> 18:16.430
How dare you deceive me?

311
18:27.270 --> 18:29.290
Why didn't you dodge?

312
18:30.400 --> 18:32.020
Master,

313
18:32.900 --> 18:33.880
save me.

314
18:34.720 --> 18:36.200
-It hurts. -I'm here.

315
18:36.200 --> 18:36.970
It hurts.

316
18:37.310 --> 18:38.320
It hurts.

317
18:38.830 --> 18:39.640
I'm here.

318
18:39.640 --> 18:40.840
It's okay. It's okay.

319
18:53.110 --> 18:54.640
It's okay. you're fine now.

320
18:56.510 --> 18:57.310
Master.

321
18:57.680 --> 18:58.920
When I grow up,

322
18:58.920 --> 19:01.510
I'll also make locust flower pancakes for you.

323
19:01.510 --> 19:02.400
Do you mean it?

324
19:02.510 --> 19:03.350
I do.

325
19:03.350 --> 19:03.920
Pinky swear?

326
19:03.920 --> 19:05.640
Cross my heart, for real,

327
19:05.640 --> 19:07.480
-on god, pinky swear. -on god, pinky swear.

328
19:07.480 --> 19:09.310
Whoever breaks his word is a pig.

329
19:11.920 --> 19:12.720
Master.

330
19:12.830 --> 19:15.360
You saved me, an abandoned child of Great Shi.

331
19:15.680 --> 19:17.340
That was a life-saving grace.

332
19:18.110 --> 19:20.440
If the day ever comes when we meet on the battlefield,

333
19:20.440 --> 19:22.300
and you must take my life, Master,

334
19:22.440 --> 19:24.590
I won't hold it against you.

335
19:25.480 --> 19:26.310
That strike—

336
19:27.720 --> 19:29.070
I was willing to take it.

337
19:30.440 --> 19:32.470
If you want to sever ties with me,

338
19:33.680 --> 19:35.560
why wait until then?

339
20:13.400 --> 20:15.270
You raised me, an abandoned child of Great Shi,

340
20:15.270 --> 20:16.440
for 17 years.

341
20:18.230 --> 20:20.360
For that, I owe you a debt of gratitude.

342
20:21.590 --> 20:23.400
You and I stand on opposite sides,

343
20:23.400 --> 20:25.000
each serving our own master.

344
20:25.640 --> 20:26.680
If you

345
20:27.790 --> 20:29.790
insist on remaining loyal to Liluo,

346
20:30.590 --> 20:31.790
I would never presume

347
20:33.000 --> 20:35.030
to say that you are in the wrong.

348
20:37.310 --> 20:38.480
That second strike—

349
20:39.680 --> 20:41.450
I was also willing to take it.

350
21:03.160 --> 21:03.960
Master.

351
21:05.960 --> 21:06.750
Now that

352
21:07.880 --> 21:11.310
this piece has returned to the board,

353
21:11.990 --> 21:14.120
I hold a position of great importance.

354
21:14.480 --> 21:16.880
I owe it all to your guidance and teachings.

355
21:18.200 --> 21:19.750
I'll follow your example

356
21:20.590 --> 21:22.550
and protect my homeland,

357
21:23.440 --> 21:25.100
and personally slay the enemy

358
21:26.030 --> 21:28.270
in defense of our Great Shi Empire.

359
21:54.000 --> 21:55.310
You are

360
21:56.030 --> 21:58.030
seeking your own death.

361
22:10.960 --> 22:11.960
You promised

362
22:12.960 --> 22:15.960
to make locust flower pancakes for me with your own hands.

363
22:15.960 --> 22:18.680
You also promised you'd care for me in my old age.

364
22:20.000 --> 22:21.400
We could have been a loving father and filial son,

365
22:21.400 --> 22:22.860
living happily together,

366
22:23.000 --> 22:25.070
but you had to turn things into this!

367
22:25.070 --> 22:27.670
Tell me, aren't you bringing this on yourself?

368
22:30.350 --> 22:31.160
Master.

369
22:33.350 --> 22:35.280
I have to thank you for striking me.

370
22:36.880 --> 22:37.750
With that,

371
22:39.070 --> 22:40.600
I consider the debt I owe you

372
22:41.270 --> 22:42.880
repaid.

373
22:48.480 --> 22:49.880
From this day forth,

374
22:50.750 --> 22:51.550
you

375
22:53.000 --> 22:55.000
are no longer my master.

376
23:07.000 --> 23:09.930
The Soaring Dragon Thousand-Mechanism Formation,

377
23:10.350 --> 23:12.210
using all things as instruments.

378
23:17.200 --> 23:19.110
The skills I taught you

379
23:19.720 --> 23:22.270
are enough to make you the envy of the world!

380
23:24.240 --> 23:25.770
Talking about repaying me?

381
23:26.350 --> 23:28.150
With what do you plan to repay me?

382
23:47.200 --> 23:49.200
This is what it means to repay a debt.

383
23:54.200 --> 23:58.160
To repay it in full!

384
24:29.400 --> 24:31.160
I'll give you one last chance.

385
24:31.680 --> 24:33.160
Serve Liluo,

386
24:36.310 --> 24:37.710
and I'll spare your life.

387
24:41.880 --> 24:42.680
Li San.

388
24:43.480 --> 24:45.440
You want me to side with demon-men

389
24:45.440 --> 24:46.770
and commit atrocities?

390
24:47.240 --> 24:48.570
Then between you and me,

391
24:49.720 --> 24:51.880
there's only a fight to the death.

392
25:01.480 --> 25:04.080
Then I suppose we have nothing left to discuss.

393
25:25.200 --> 25:26.440
Seventeen years ago,

394
25:26.440 --> 25:29.480
Liluo took the lives of my parents and my little brother.

395
25:29.480 --> 25:31.110
That debt must also

396
25:31.110 --> 25:33.190
be repaid in full.

397
25:37.440 --> 25:38.880
In this life,

398
25:39.400 --> 25:41.440
there's never enough wine to drink,

399
25:41.720 --> 25:44.000
nor enough grudges and debts to settle.

400
25:52.550 --> 25:53.810
When the wine runs dry,

401
25:53.960 --> 25:55.620
the grudge should end with it.

402
25:55.680 --> 25:56.920
Who would have thought that,

403
25:56.920 --> 25:59.590
somehow, your life would

404
25:59.590 --> 26:01.510
come to an end like this?

405
26:22.160 --> 26:23.420
Lord Constable Ghost.

406
26:23.480 --> 26:26.680
Are you looking for the Chiying tattoo?

407
26:54.350 --> 26:55.590
Lord Constable Ghost,

408
26:55.590 --> 26:57.110
did you see it clearly?

409
27:05.680 --> 27:06.830
I almost forgot.

410
27:06.920 --> 27:09.240
Seventeen years ago in this very place,

411
27:09.270 --> 27:11.350
I buried 2 things.

412
27:12.440 --> 27:13.270
Now,

413
27:13.480 --> 27:14.200
it's time

414
27:14.200 --> 27:16.680
to bring them back to light!

415
27:44.050 --> 27:44.850
Is it pretty?

416
27:44.960 --> 27:45.950
It is.

417
27:46.160 --> 27:47.290
It's pretty, right?

418
28:33.270 --> 28:34.670
Shen Jing'an.

419
28:35.880 --> 28:36.920
Your parents, whom you've searched for

420
28:36.920 --> 28:38.550
all these years,

421
28:39.000 --> 28:40.270
are right here.

422
28:50.230 --> 28:51.240
How about it?

423
28:51.400 --> 28:53.870
I left their bodies intact.

424
28:53.960 --> 28:56.620
That should be enough to make it up to you, right?

425
29:18.270 --> 29:20.550
Come on, take them home and lay them to rest.

426
29:20.550 --> 29:22.150
Give them a proper burial,

427
29:22.830 --> 29:24.310
with all due honors.

428
29:36.200 --> 29:37.970
Poor soul.

429
29:39.720 --> 29:40.990
Seventeen years ago,

430
29:41.110 --> 29:42.910
the one who killed your parents,

431
29:43.270 --> 29:44.930
wiped out your entire family,

432
29:45.000 --> 29:46.270
and abducted your younger brother

433
29:46.270 --> 29:48.330
to take someone else's place in death

434
29:49.880 --> 29:53.440
was me, Li San.

435
30:00.070 --> 30:00.830
Meng Rui!

436
30:02.000 --> 30:03.660
Whether you believe it or not,

437
30:03.790 --> 30:04.720
I also

438
30:06.000 --> 30:07.800
only found out about this today.

439
30:08.270 --> 30:09.480
But no matter what,

440
30:10.200 --> 30:11.460
your family's tragedy

441
30:12.720 --> 30:14.270
is indeed related to me.

442
30:18.590 --> 30:19.830
I owe you.

443
30:27.270 --> 30:28.530
Lord Constable Ghost!

444
30:30.270 --> 30:32.390
I hope you understand that,

445
30:32.960 --> 30:34.440
in this mortal world,

446
30:35.680 --> 30:38.070
we are all but pawns in a greater game.

447
32:02.270 --> 32:05.470
Every grudge has its cause, and every debt has its debtor.

448
32:05.480 --> 32:06.740
Lord Constable Ghost,

449
32:09.310 --> 32:10.310
draw your sword.

450
32:35.790 --> 32:37.100
Little brat.

451
32:40.000 --> 32:41.260
Does it look familiar?

452
32:45.200 --> 32:46.310
The puppet doll

453
32:47.590 --> 32:49.590
you've been searching for

454
32:49.590 --> 32:51.070
all these years

455
32:51.350 --> 32:54.830
is precisely my specialty.

456
33:01.070 --> 33:03.110
Then Wen Nansheng's puppetry...

457
33:03.680 --> 33:06.200
The one who passed the puppetry to Wen Nansheng

458
33:06.200 --> 33:07.340
and had him cultivate

459
33:07.340 --> 33:09.240
the fruit of immortality of Tianmoluo

460
33:09.240 --> 33:10.030
was me.

461
33:11.480 --> 33:13.480
The one who told Tang Wei about his background,

462
33:13.480 --> 33:15.350
taught him the Illusion of Mirrors and Water,

463
33:15.350 --> 33:17.590
and secretly helped him seek revenge

464
33:18.960 --> 33:20.640
was also me.

465
33:21.640 --> 33:22.480
However,

466
33:23.070 --> 33:25.020
Wen Nansheng's puppetry

467
33:25.040 --> 33:26.350
was merely the basics.

468
33:26.720 --> 33:27.590
Today,

469
33:29.000 --> 33:31.640
let me show you, Lord Constable Ghost,

470
33:31.920 --> 33:33.920
what the real

471
33:34.480 --> 33:37.390
Five Wonders of Liluo can do!

472
34:21.920 --> 34:23.179
I was outmatched.

473
34:23.760 --> 34:24.949
I admit defeat.

474
34:25.880 --> 34:28.480
What a pity— after all these years of planning.

475
34:28.840 --> 34:29.840
Seventeen years ago,

476
34:29.840 --> 34:32.070
when you killed my parents and little brother,

477
34:32.070 --> 34:34.199
did you ever think this day would come?

478
34:36.400 --> 34:37.710
The fear you feel now

479
34:37.710 --> 34:40.110
is nothing compared to what they suffered.

480
34:54.110 --> 34:56.090
This grudge goes back

481
34:57.190 --> 34:59.250
far longer than 17 years, doesn't it?

482
35:01.480 --> 35:03.550
It goes back 47 years.

483
35:05.480 --> 35:06.880
That day, when Tang Wei

484
35:08.070 --> 35:09.320
killed Huang Gang

485
35:10.360 --> 35:12.480
and beheaded Jiang Zeshui,

486
35:13.360 --> 35:15.020
he said the exact same things.

487
35:16.630 --> 35:17.890
Lord Constable Ghost,

488
35:18.280 --> 35:20.230
you are much luckier than Tang Wei.

489
35:27.190 --> 35:28.000
Come on.

490
35:28.330 --> 35:30.300
Do it.

491
35:40.590 --> 35:41.540
Hurry.

492
35:42.280 --> 35:43.290
No...

493
35:45.760 --> 35:49.230
Do it!

494
35:49.400 --> 35:50.190
No!

495
36:08.880 --> 36:10.040
Li Si!

496
36:18.550 --> 36:20.410
Meng Rui won't think to look for us

497
36:20.800 --> 36:22.480
at his own home anytime soon.

498
36:24.880 --> 36:25.940
Stand straighter!

499
36:27.150 --> 36:27.960
We should

500
36:28.800 --> 36:30.110
be safe here for now.

501
36:31.070 --> 36:33.070
Letting me die in the Shen residence—

502
36:33.070 --> 36:34.510
how evil of you.

503
36:35.960 --> 36:36.880
Shut up!

504
36:38.150 --> 36:39.280
This must be karma.

505
36:41.510 --> 36:42.320
Get off me!

506
36:44.670 --> 36:45.550
Stay back!

507
36:47.280 --> 36:48.150
Stay back.

508
36:57.800 --> 36:59.630
Didn't you sever ties with me?

509
37:02.590 --> 37:03.920
Then why did you save me?

510
37:12.670 --> 37:14.600
That strike with the ruler just now

511
37:14.670 --> 37:15.630
was vicious,

512
37:16.800 --> 37:19.400
but you deliberately avoided my vital points.

513
37:24.920 --> 37:26.070
I'm just getting old

514
37:27.070 --> 37:28.150
and past my prime.

515
37:29.840 --> 37:30.630
Li Si.

516
37:31.440 --> 37:32.230
No.

517
37:34.280 --> 37:35.510
I mean, Zhou Yan.

518
37:37.150 --> 37:37.960
Remember,

519
37:38.760 --> 37:40.870
you have to be ruthless

520
37:42.710 --> 37:43.850
to survive.

521
37:45.590 --> 37:47.720
If you're soft-hearted and hesitant,

522
37:48.510 --> 37:50.910
you'll never stand a chance against Liluo.

523
37:55.760 --> 37:57.560
There's no point in saying more.

524
38:21.820 --> 38:23.680
Now that things have come to this,

525
38:24.710 --> 38:25.670
do you have any

526
38:25.670 --> 38:27.110
unfulfilled wishes?

527
38:28.280 --> 38:29.070
I...

528
38:34.960 --> 38:36.880
I was born a citizen of Liluo,

529
38:39.280 --> 38:41.080
and I will die a ghost of Liluo.

530
38:43.150 --> 38:44.550
I have no regrets.

531
38:48.540 --> 38:50.230
♪ Night deepens, spreading like ink over rivers and mountains ♪

532
38:50.230 --> 38:51.000
Master.

533
38:51.000 --> 38:52.230
When I grow up,

534
38:52.230 --> 38:54.760
I'll also make locust flower pancakes for you.

535
38:54.760 --> 38:59.100
♪ I'm a spark that refuses to die ♪

536
39:00.490 --> 39:05.480
♪ Riding the wind, a thousand years pass in a fleeting moment ♪

537
39:06.570 --> 39:10.320
♪ Seeking the song left unsung ♪

538
39:10.320 --> 39:11.110
Old man.

539
39:12.670 --> 39:12.940
But I still remember

540
39:12.940 --> 39:15.800
♪ Fleeting light fades like fragile promises ♪

541
39:15.800 --> 39:17.200
that I owe you something.

542
39:19.320 --> 39:25.020
♪ Who softly sings along from the far shore? ♪

543
39:25.610 --> 39:30.800
♪ I'm the poem that keeps summer nights awake ♪

544
39:31.560 --> 39:36.870
♪ I'm amber that defies the passage of time ♪

545
39:37.770 --> 39:43.300
♪ A fleeting glimmer entwines with eternity ♪

546
39:43.740 --> 39:49.350
♪ Rewrite the loneliness of time and space ♪

547
39:50.310 --> 39:54.000
♪ Let longing become ♪

548
39:54.000 --> 39:56.890
My hands are stained with the blood of countless people,

549
39:56.890 --> 39:59.990
♪ Every word whispered on the wind ♪

550
40:00.150 --> 40:02.950
yet somehow I ended up raising a disciple like you.

551
40:09.230 --> 40:10.280
I should never have saved you

552
40:10.280 --> 40:12.280
17 years ago.

553
40:15.960 --> 40:18.290
There is no cure for the Chiying Bug Venom.

554
40:19.550 --> 40:20.590
You will eventually

555
40:20.590 --> 40:23.190
become nothing more than a puppet of Liluo.

556
40:26.070 --> 40:26.880
Remember,

557
40:29.480 --> 40:31.010
the only thing in this world

558
40:32.750 --> 40:35.280
that can save your life is the Ode to Canglang.

559
40:35.320 --> 40:37.000
Only the Ode to Canglang...

560
40:39.070 --> 40:40.510
can save your...

561
40:41.110 --> 40:41.920
life.

562
41:46.560 --> 41:46.710
♪ Capture my heart ♪

563
41:46.710 --> 41:47.510
Old man.

564
41:49.670 --> 41:50.190
Here.

565
41:50.190 --> 41:53.450
♪ Unravel my longing ♪

566
41:54.490 --> 41:56.670
♪ Can we relive the mark you once carved deep? ♪

567
41:56.670 --> 41:57.840
Didn't I promise

568
42:00.000 --> 42:00.320
that I'd make locust flower pancakes for you?

569
42:00.320 --> 42:03.650
♪ Turns out every soul ♪

570
42:04.210 --> 42:07.480
♪ Fears deep devotion ♪

571
42:07.480 --> 42:08.440
I worked so hard to make them.

572
42:08.440 --> 42:11.000
♪ In a moment, I fell, a lifetime left to heal ♪

573
42:11.000 --> 42:12.440
At least take a bite.

574
42:14.840 --> 42:17.810
♪ Tossing and turning through endless nights ♪

575
42:18.070 --> 42:18.810
Come on.

576
42:18.810 --> 42:21.710
♪ Breaking free from a labyrinth ♪

577
42:22.840 --> 42:28.000
♪ Will we meet again, those I dare not face? ♪

578
42:28.940 --> 42:31.890
♪ One thought to ferry me across the sea of suffering ♪

579
42:32.850 --> 42:35.750
♪ One thought to burn me to ash ♪

580
42:36.950 --> 42:42.920
♪ A thousand schemes can never be enough, till all turn to dust ♪

581
42:43.190 --> 42:46.250
♪ Dare not forget ♪

582
42:47.200 --> 42:50.110
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

583
42:50.920 --> 42:56.650
♪ In love, I fear neither life nor death ♪

584
42:57.700 --> 43:00.190
♪ I turn a blind eye ♪

585
43:00.950 --> 43:03.740
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

586
43:04.920 --> 43:11.500
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

587
43:12.910 --> 43:16.810
♪ Forever within your shadow by your side ♪
